message: "If you use whatsent in research or reporting, cite it as below."
title: whatsent
abstract: >-
  A command line tool that runs an AI coding agent inside a throwaway project
  full of planted canary values and records what the agent sends off the
  machine, using a local proxy, a disk watch and a bypass check.
type: software
